--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d22778bf57e3fca41942264a944f8db6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chapter One Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - text: Hey. Still not answering my calls, huh?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Don''t blame you. I wouldn''t either. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Listen. I have my regrets. We both do. Your Mother and I. We were lost
      for a long time. Kept telling ourselves we were doing our best. Guess we were
      wrong.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "We should\u2019ve been there for you, especially for the times when you
      needed us most. We know that now. "
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Your mother talks about you all the time. She keeps asking if you\u2019re
      ever coming home. I\u2019ll tell her I don\u2019t know. She doesn't remember
      how she treated you. But she remembers the good memories she had.  "
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Your mother talks about you all the time. She keeps asking if you\u2019re
      ever coming home. I\u2019ll tell her I don\u2019t know. She doesn't remember
      how she treated you. But she remembers the good memories she had. Her memory
      isn't what it used to be. She's starting to forget things. Not just that. More
      mundane things too. Like where the bathroom is located in the house or what
      our cat's name is. "
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We had to shut down the hotel once her condition worsened. I'm staying
      home with her as we try to navigate this together. Through sickness and in
      health, right?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'The hotel is yours now if you want it. Keys are in the security box by
      the front doors. Code is 4673. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Remember when we used to play Hide and Seek on the first floor? You used
      to always hide in room 101 becasue you said it looked like lol and it made
      you laugh. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Upper floors are blocked off.  Elevator was shut down back in February.
      We couldn't afford the repairs.  Can't afford much of anything right now.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Lights still work. Most of the time. And some rooms might need a bit of
      sprucing up. But I'm sure that's not too much for you to handle.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026would be nice seeing this place alive again."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Hope to hear from you. Love you. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
